{{define "settings_editor_lsp.gohtml"}}
{{template "app_start.gohtml" .}}
{{template "editor_page_start.gohtml" .}}
<form method="post" action="/settings/editor/lsp" id="settings-editor-lsp">
  <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{.CSRFToken}}">
  <div class="mb-3 row">
    <div class="col-12 col-sm-7 col-lg-5">
      <label class="form-label" for="editor-lsp-idle">Idle timeout</label>
      <div class="input-group">
        <input class="form-control" type="number" id="editor-lsp-idle" name="idle_seconds" min="{{.LSPIdleMin}}" max="{{.LSPIdleMax}}" step="1" required value="{{.LSPIdleSeconds}}">
        <span class="input-group-text">seconds</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-text">Stops a project's servers when its editor was not used for this long. Default {{.LSPIdleDefault}}, minimum {{.LSPIdleMin}}, maximum {{.LSPIdleMax}}.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mb-3 row">
    <div class="col-12 col-sm-7 col-lg-5">
      <label class="form-label" for="editor-lsp-max-projects">Max running projects</label>
      <input class="form-control" type="number" id="editor-lsp-max-projects" name="max_projects" min="{{.LSPMaxProjectsMin}}" max="{{.LSPMaxProjectsMax}}" step="1" required value="{{.LSPMaxProjects}}">
      <div class="form-text">Projects with running servers at the same time, all languages of a project count as one. Another project stops the least recently used one, unless all are busy. Default {{.LSPMaxProjectsDefault}}, minimum {{.LSPMaxProjectsMin}}, maximum {{.LSPMaxProjectsMax}}.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <hr class="my-4">
  <div class="text-secondary small mb-3">Go to definition and Find usages ask a language server per language, which the cockpit runs in a container, its image built on this host on first use. Automatic runs it while the Docker daemon answers and stays off otherwise; Off takes the surface away for that language entirely.</div>
  <div class="mb-3 row">
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
      {{range .LSPProfiles}}
      <div class="mb-3">
        <label class="form-label" for="editor-lsp-{{.ID}}">{{.Label}}</label>
        <select class="form-select" id="editor-lsp-{{.ID}}" name="server_{{.ID}}">
          <option value="auto"{{if eq .Selected "auto"}} selected{{end}}>Automatic</option>
          <option value="{{.Server}}-docker"{{if eq .Selected (printf "%s-docker" .Server)}} selected{{end}}>{{.Server}} (Docker)</option>
          <option value="off"{{if eq .Selected "off"}} selected{{end}}>Off</option>
        </select>
        <div class="form-text">Runs <code>{{.Command}}</code>; {{if .DockerOK}}the daemon answers{{else}}no daemon answers right now{{end}}.</div>
      </div>
      {{end}}
    </div>
  </div>
  <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Save</button>
</form>
{{template "editor_page_end.gohtml"}}
{{template "app_end.gohtml" .}}
{{end}}
